{
  "name": "Product photo to video ad with Nano Banana Pro and Kling 3 (MegaBrain)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# Product photo → video ad\nUpload-free UGC ad pipeline: paste a product photo URL and one line about the product.\n1. A free text model writes the scene.\n2. **Nano Banana Pro Edit** puts the product into a lifestyle shot (keeps the label).\n3. **Kling 3** animates that shot into a vertical 5-second clip.\n\nCost: about $0.17 for the image + $0.48 for 5 s of video.\n\n## Setup (2 minutes)\n1. Get a key at [getmegabrain.com/keys](https://getmegabrain.com/keys).\n2. In n8n create a **Header Auth** credential named `MegaBrain API key`:\n   - Name: `Authorization`\n   - Value: `Bearer YOUR_KEY`\n3. Pick it in every HTTP Request node with the 🔑 mark.\n\nFailed jobs are refunded automatically. Prices: [getmegabrain.com/docs/media](https://getmegabrain.com/docs/media).",
        "height": 620,
        "width": 440
      },
      "id": "30c73f84-6de8-5c70-a823-15690b0094ee",
      "name": "About",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -520,
        -300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "formTitle": "Product photo → video ad",
        "formDescription": "Paste a public link to a product photo. The video link appears here in 2–4 minutes.",
        "formFields": {
          "values": [
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Product photo URL",
              "requiredField": true,
              "placeholder": "https://…/bottle.png"
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Product",
              "requiredField": true,
              "placeholder": "cold brew coffee in a glass bottle"
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Audience",
              "placeholder": "busy students"
            }
          ]
        },
        "responseMode": "lastNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "dade61fb-aff4-535d-9165-bb44b99a41eb",
      "name": "Product form",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.formTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "webhookId": "261c71a1-4009-5b3c-86c2-56c857418645"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://getmegabrain.com/api/gateway/v1/chat/completions",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ model: 'mb-auto/free', response_format: { type: 'json_object' }, messages: [ { role: 'system', content: 'You direct short UGC-style product ads. Reply with JSON only: {\"image_prompt\": how to place the product from the photo in a realistic lifestyle scene, keep the product and its label unchanged, \"video_prompt\": what happens in 5 seconds, natural handheld phone camera, one simple action}' }, { role: 'user', content: `Product: ${$json.Product}. Audience: ${$json.Audience || 'everyone'}` } ] }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 120000
        },
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth"
      },
      "id": "7f4eae98-2761-5de1-be2c-078f5cd511fa",
      "name": "Write the scene (free model)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        220,
        0
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "mbHeaderAuth0001",
          "name": "MegaBrain API key"
        }
      },
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "waitBetweenTries": 3000
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const raw = $input.first().json.choices[0].message.content;\nconst text = raw.replace(/^```(?:json)?\\s*/i, '').replace(/```\\s*$/, '').trim();\nreturn [{ json: JSON.parse(text) }];"
      },
      "id": "ad40323b-8b46-5219-9df0-6e1777721d3d",
      "name": "Parse the scene",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        440,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://getmegabrain.com/api/gateway/v1/images/generations",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ model: 'nano-banana-pro/edit', prompt: $json.image_prompt, image_urls: [ $('Product form').item.json['Product photo URL'] ], aspect_ratio: '9:16', resolution: '1K' }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 120000
        },
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth"
      },
      "id": "3e472ac4-66d3-5973-82c5-1124e0819b15",
      "name": "Lifestyle shot (Nano Banana Pro Edit)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        660,
        0
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "mbHeaderAuth0001",
          "name": "MegaBrain API key"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://getmegabrain.com/api/gateway/v1/queue/kling-video/v3/standard/image-to-video",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ prompt: $('Parse the scene').item.json.video_prompt, start_image_url: $json.data[0].url, duration: '5', generate_audio: false }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 120000
        },
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth"
      },
      "id": "642c5d04-21e0-5123-a914-784c84311e1e",
      "name": "Submit Kling 3 image-to-video",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
